# 🧠 Fund Factsheet RAG Chatbot  
### _An Intelligent Multimodal RAG System for Fund Analysis using PDFs, Charts, and Tables_

![Python](https://img.shields.io/badge/Python-3.10+-blue)
![Docker](https://img.shields.io/badge/Docker-Supported-green)
![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow)

---

## 📘 Overview

The **Fund Factsheet RAG Chatbot** is a modular **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)** system that reads **fund factsheet PDFs** (text + tables + charts), extracts structured information, stores it as embeddings in **Chroma DB**, and lets you **ask questions conversationally** through a **Streamlit chat UI** backed by a **FastAPI** service.

---


## 🧩 Key Features

✅ Extracts **text, tables, and charts (OCR)** from PDFs  
✅ Uses **Hugging Face models** for embeddings and OCR  
✅ Stores embeddings in **Chroma Vector Database**  
✅ Provides a **FastAPI backend** for question answering  
✅ Interactive **Streamlit frontend** for chatting  
✅ Fully **Dockerized** for easy deployment  
✅ Modular, extensible architecture  

---

