## Project Structure

```
fund_factsheet_rag/
├── .env                        # Environment variables (API keys, model names)
├── configs/
│   └── config.yaml             # Global configuration file
├── requirements.txt            # Python dependencies
├── docker-compose.yml          # Docker orchestration file
├── Dockerfile                  # Docker image configuration
├── setup.py                    # Python package setup
│
├── data/
│   ├── raw_pdfs/               # Input fund factsheets
│   ├── extracted_images/       # Extracted charts/images
│   └── parsed_tables/          # Extracted tables
│
├── scripts/
│   └── ingest_from_folder.py   # Extract + embed all PDFs
│
├── services/
│   ├── fastapi_api/app.py      # FastAPI backend
│   └── streamlit_ui/app.py     # Streamlit chatbot UI
│
└── src/fund_factsheet_rag/
    ├── ingestion/              # PDF reading
    ├── extraction/             # OCR and table extraction
    ├── preprocessing/          # Caption generation / cleaning
    ├── embeddings/             # Text embedding generation
    ├── indexer/                # Chroma vector store
    ├── retriever/              # Retrieval pipeline
    ├── calculations/           # Finance metric functions
    └── storage/

```

---

⚙️ Installation (Manual Setup)

1️⃣ Clone the Repository
```

git clone https://github.com/NeHa77A/Fund-Factsheet-RAG-Chatbot.git
cd Fund-Factsheet-RAG-Chatbot
```

2️⃣ Create and Activate a Virtual Environment
```
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
```

3️⃣ Install Dependencies
```
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

4️⃣ Set Environment Variables

Create a .env file in your root directory:
```
HUGGINGFACE_API_KEY=your_huggingface_token
TEXT_EMBED_MODEL=sentence-transformers/all-mpnet-base-v2
OCR_MODEL=microsoft/trocr-base-printed
```
5️⃣ Add PDFs

Place all your factsheet PDFs in:

data/raw_pdfs/

6️⃣ Run the Ingestion Pipeline
```
python scripts/ingest_from_folder.py
```
7️⃣ Start the FastAPI Backend
```
uvicorn services.fastapi_api.app:app --reload
```

Access: http://localhost:8000/docs

8️⃣ Start the Streamlit Frontend
streamlit run services/streamlit_ui/app.py


Access: http://localhost:8501

🐳 Run Everything Using Docker (Recommended)
1️⃣ Build Docker Image
```
sudo docker compose build
```
2️⃣ Run All Services
```
sudo docker compose up
```
3️⃣ Access the Application
Service	URL
FastAPI Docs	http://localhost:8000/docs

Streamlit Chatbot UI	http://localhost:8501
4️⃣ Stop Containers
```
sudo docker compose down
```

Persistent data is automatically stored in:

./data/        → PDFs & images  
./.chromadb/   → Vector embeddings


| Component                   | Model                                     | Description             |
| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |
| **Text Embeddings**         | `sentence-transformers/all-mpnet-base-v2` | For semantic search     |
| **OCR (Charts)**            | `microsoft/trocr-base-printed`            | Extracts chart text     |
| **LLM (Answer Generation)** | `HuggingFaceH4/zephyr-7b-beta`            | Generates final answers |
| **Vector DB**               | `Chroma`                                  | Stores embeddings       |
| **Frontend**                | `Streamlit`                               | Chat interface          |
| **Backend**                 | `FastAPI`                                 | Retrieval + LLM logic   |


---
## Deployment

Host a Docker application on Streamlit
